{"h":11508,"lines":[{"y":0.94323812476965596,"text":"\"I know that Thou art the eternal source,","x":0.18975612167311265,"w":0.58249718802315853,"conf":1,"h":0.022952390095544173},{"w":0.58907362702605015,"text":"The fountain of all goodness and all grace,","y":0.92005813950438164,"x":0.20665084218768737,"h":0.021906145981379854,"conf":1},{"h":0.020394979015229242,"text":"Whence flow to men, in never-failing course,","conf":1,"x":0.20665083846552282,"y":0.89825581425707801,"w":0.61520187576095786},{"x":0.20902613350148758,"text":"All joy and blessings from the heavenly place.","conf":1,"y":0.87500000038110903,"w":0.62945368382837852,"h":0.020348836505223789},{"w":0.45843228426846594,"text":"What are we, and what have we,","y":0.85168650804874257,"h":0.020406514879256932,"x":0.23990500182855404,"conf":1},{"x":0.23990499280277863,"w":0.36342041213791088,"y":0.83430232523257908,"h":0.015988372621082103,"text":"On this whole earth below","conf":1},{"text":"That springs not, Father God, from Thee","y":0.80668604682632927,"conf":1,"w":0.56769596446644177,"x":0.23990499094289039,"h":0.021802325097341368},{"w":0.38954868564358003,"conf":1,"text":"Who dost all good bestow?\"","h":0.021911913440341046,"x":0.23990499666752105,"y":0.78488372144478857},{"text":"Who can sincerely speak in these terms? Only the man who","conf":1,"x":0.11638956443970505,"y":0.75436046555137481,"h":0.020441121525234585,"w":0.81235152405577826},{"x":0.11163894792081414,"w":0.81947742808948854,"h":0.021871539335402201,"conf":1,"text":"acknowledges God's sovereign freedom, who opens his","y":0.73110465131397462},{"x":0.11163895842365389,"conf":1,"y":0.70930232593343456,"text":"heart to the overflowing and free goodness of God, and does","w":0.81710211023107737,"h":0.020360372369251589},{"text":"so by actively exercising kindness and generosity himself.","w":0.81947742808948854,"h":0.0203488365052239,"conf":1,"y":0.68750000037280334,"x":0.11163896401769197},{"h":0.020406514879256932,"y":0.664186508121417,"conf":1,"text":"The eyes of such a one are opened to the abounding grace of","w":0.81947742808948876,"x":0.11401425962904814},{"h":0.020429586607312311,"y":0.64236111073583113,"x":0.11401427138598816,"w":0.81710211023107737,"conf":1,"text":"God which reigns over all things and prevails in all things."},{"w":0.81947742808948854,"conf":1,"text":"Thus too our parable, if we give heed to it with willing ears,","h":0.020446889930301304,"y":0.61918604683459733,"x":0.11163896635905597},{"text":"will be seen as a gift of God's sovereign goodness disclosed","y":0.59738372131960971,"h":0.018935722964150581,"w":0.81710211023107748,"conf":1,"x":0.11163896280098655},{"conf":1,"text":"in Jesus; a gift which shames us and frees us from the cal-","y":0.57264197846910303,"w":0.81966846020190742,"h":0.023320733554779483,"x":0.10915930206016189},{"conf":1,"x":0.11149594429590309,"y":0.55187562737631979,"w":0.81737354823521202,"h":0.022584718371194579,"text":"culating coldness of our hearts. And so then let us take to"},{"h":0.020400747420295851,"conf":1,"w":0.65083134638798712,"text":"heart the truth enshrined in the poet's words:1","x":0.11163896104987031,"y":0.52901785670925405},{"y":0.491280315943738,"w":0.43840992915165888,"h":0.02779476699374972,"text":"\"Thou, like every child of man,","conf":1,"x":0.25108229164781148},{"h":0.020423818202245814,"w":0.38004748852221998,"y":0.47238372107878346,"text":"In this world hast no rights:","x":0.27078385939684729,"conf":1},{"text":"All the creatures God has made","conf":1,"x":0.27078385009387829,"y":0.45337301606337033,"w":0.44418052574256794,"h":0.016121031746031744},{"x":0.27078383812348461,"conf":1,"w":0.42280286318295957,"text":"Are guests at a strange hearth.","y":0.42732558191696168,"h":0.0203488365052239},{"x":0.27078384940271683,"y":0.40843023315442817,"conf":1,"w":0.38242280638063109,"text":"God is master in His house","h":0.01744185932098874},{"x":0.270783857689541,"h":0.021911913440341046,"y":0.38070436536014651,"text":"And, as He wills, His gifts imparts.\"","conf":1,"w":0.50831351342139297},{"conf":1,"text":"1 Paul Gerhardt.","x":0.38954870056415614,"y":0.3372093018616974,"h":0.015988372621082103,"w":0.18289785261278024},{"w":0.047505939161622712,"conf":1,"x":0.49643705443607966,"y":0.087209302236163744,"h":0.014534884028964634,"text":"188"}],"page":184,"w":7029}